sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Controller as AccountCommandController
    participant Gateway as CommandGateway
    participant Aggregate as AccountAggregate
    participant Store as Axon Server EventStore
    participant Projector as AccountEventHandler
    participant DB as PostgreSQL read model

    Client->>Controller: POST /commands/accounts/add<br/>{initialBalance, currency}
    Controller->>Controller: Generate UUID accountId
    Controller->>Gateway: AddAccountCommand
    Gateway->>Aggregate: Route by @TargetAggregateIdentifier
    Aggregate->>Aggregate: Validate initialBalance > 0
    Aggregate->>Store: AccountCreatedEvent + AccountActivatedEvent
    Store-->>Gateway: Command accepted
    Gateway-->>Controller: CompletableFuture<String>
    Controller-->>Client: accountId
    Store->>Projector: Publish account events
    Projector->>DB: Insert Account with CREATED status
    Projector->>DB: Update Account to ACTIVATED

    Note over Client,DB: Credit, debit and status updates follow the same CQRS path.

    Client->>Controller: POST /credit or /debit, PUT /updateStatus
    Controller->>Gateway: CreditAccountCommand / DebitAccountCommand /<br/>UpdateAccountStatusCommand
    Gateway->>Aggregate: Load aggregate from its event history
    Aggregate->>Aggregate: Check activated status, positive amount<br/>and sufficient balance for debit
    Aggregate->>Store: AccountCreditedEvent / AccountDebitedEvent /<br/>AccountStatusUpdatedEvent
    Store->>Projector: Publish new event
    Projector->>DB: Update balance/status and save operation when applicable
    Controller-->>Client: Command result
